    {
      "id": 24313,
      "nameEs": "Cool Boarders 4",
      "originalName": "Cool Boarders 4",
      "year": 1999,
      "igdbId": 26131,
      "popularity": 0,
      "iconic": false,
      "fields": [
        {
          "field": "name_es",
          "value": "Cool Boarders 4",
          "source": "igdb",
          "manual": false
        },
        {
          "field": "original_name",
          "value": "Cool Boarders 4",
          "source": "igdb",
          "manual": false
        },
        {
          "field": "summary",
          "value": "Cool Boarders 4 features 16 real-life professional snowboarders ranging from 13 year-old prodigy Shaun White to veterans such as Noah Salasnek and living-legend Jim Rippey. Players also have the ability to custom-create a rider by selecting a body, choosing brand name attire and gear, and customizing any available board to your liking. Players can choose among 34 boards from Burton, Forum, K2, MLY, M3, Salomon, Ride, Morrow and Santa Cruz.\n\nThere are over 30 new courses spread out over five authentic mountains that are filled with steep cliffs, drops, jumps, rails and various obstacles. Cool Boarders 4 also features Dirty Hands by hard rock artist, Outer Circle. And the game is compatible with the Dual Shock Analog Controller and your choice of memory cards.After three top sellers, Cool Boarders is still the slickest competition on the slopes.\n\nCool Boarders 4 features big names like Jim Rippey, Ross Powers, Michele Taggart, J.P. Walker, Andrew Crawford, Shaun White and others; big boards like Burton, Fourm, K2, MLY, M3, Salomon, Ride, Morrow, Santa Cruz; big mountains and big features; big customization; a big trickmaster mode; big events; a big multiplayer tournament mode; big tricks; and big brawls.",
          "source": "igdb",
          "manual": false
        },
        {
          "field": "summary_es",
          "value": "Cool Boarders 4 incluye 16 snowboarders profesionales reales, desde el prodigio de 13 años Shaun White hasta veteranos como Noah Salasnek y la leyenda viva Jim Rippey. Los jugadores también pueden crear su propio corredor seleccionando un cuerpo, eligiendo ropa y equipo de marcas conocidas, y personalizando cualquier tabla disponible a su gusto. Pueden elegir entre 34 tablas de Burton, Forum, K2, MLY, M3, Salomon, Ride, Morrow y Santa Cruz.\n\nHay más de 30 circuitos nuevos repartidos en cinco montañas auténticas, llenas de acantilados empinados, caídas, saltos, barandillas y diversos obstáculos. Cool Boarders 4 también incluye «Dirty Hands», del artista de hard rock Outer Circle. El juego es compatible con el mando analógico Dual Shock y con las tarjetas de memoria que elijas. Tras tres grandes éxitos de ventas, Cool Boarders sigue siendo la competencia más pulida de las pistas.\n\nCool Boarders 4 incluye grandes nombres como Jim Rippey, Ross Powers, Michele Taggart, J.P. Walker, Andrew Crawford, Shaun White y otros; grandes tablas como Burton, Forum, K2, MLY, M3, Salomon, Ride, Morrow y Santa Cruz; grandes montañas y grandes funciones; gran personalización; un gran modo Trickmaster; grandes eventos; un gran modo de torneo multijugador; grandes trucos; y grandes peleas.",
          "source": "claude",
          "manual": false
        },
        {
          "field": "year",
          "value": "1999",
          "source": "igdb",
          "manual": false
        }
